### Framework-Specific Implementation
This project uses **Vite + React**, and the implementation follows the exact pattern from the official documentation:
- Import: `import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/react'`
- Usage: `<Analytics />` component placed in the root App component

### Next Steps for Deployment
To activate analytics tracking in production:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel: `vercel deploy`
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Project Settings → Analytics)
3. Analytics routes will be available at `/_vercel/insights/*` after deployment
4. Verify tracking by checking browser Network tab for requests to `/_vercel/insights/view`

### Conclusion
No code changes were required as the project already has Vercel Web Analytics properly configured according to the latest official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will start tracking once deployed to Vercel with analytics enabled in the dashboard.
